# DDR4 SPD, 512 bytes. Byte 4 encodes 4 Gb, two bank groups and eight banks;
# byte 6 selects a two-die 3DS stack. CRC bytes are intentionally zero: the
# ipmitool SPD printer displays fields but does not verify the JEDEC CRC.
23 11 0c 02 54 00 92 00 00 00 00 3f 0b 0b
@pad 306 0x00
# [320:321] bank 2, Kingston
01 98
00
# [323:324] year 2025, week 37
25 37
# [325:328] serial
aa bb cc dd
# [329:348] part number, exactly 20 ASCII bytes
44 44 52 34 2d 54 45 53 54 2d 58 59 5a 2d 31 32 33 34 35 36
@pad 163 0x00
